vetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">OpenAI演示Agentic操作系统原型，实现无App手机界面实时生成</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">OpenAI正式成立Robotics事业部，由DALL-E发明者阿迪亚·拉梅什领衔</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">OpenAI尖端模型与Codex正式登陆AWS平台，支持企业级应用部署</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">谷歌母公司Alphabet拟募资800亿美元，巴菲特旗下伯克希尔参投100亿</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/0f4300690cd50684397f89db68d9d269.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">谷歌母公司Alphabet于6月1日宣布拟通过股票出售募集800亿美元，资金将全额投入AI算力基础设施建设。本轮融资包括100亿美元的伯克希尔·哈撒韦专项投资、300亿美元承销发行（含150亿美元强制可转换优先股），以及计划于2026年第三季度启动的400亿美元市场公开发行。Alphabet CEO桑达尔·皮查伊表示，当前AI解决方案需求强劲，算力供给瓶颈及电力、土地、供应链限制是制约数据中心扩张的核心因素。为应对激烈的AI军备竞赛，Alphabet已将全年资本支出预期上调至1800亿至1900亿美元，此前已通过多轮债券发行筹集超660亿美元。尽管Gemini大模型带动公司股价过去一年翻倍，但市场对巨额资本投入的产出比仍持谨慎观望态度，消息公布后盘后股价出现小幅回落。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">腾讯正在测试微信AI智能体，主打应用内任务处理并即将启动合规流程</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/71c685e2b04996a543a47fd615e2bfe1.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">腾讯正加速推进微信生态内AI智能体的落地，目前已进入原型测试阶段。该AI智能体旨在帮助用户在微信应用内部高效完成多项任务，标志着微信在智能化交互与服务闭环上迈出关键一步。为确保产品合规，腾讯计划最早于本月启动公开上线所需的合规流程。在完成相关程序后，腾讯将采取分阶段推进策略，先在小范围外部用户中进行封闭测试，随后逐步扩大开放范围。由于合规审批周期存在不确定性，最终正式发布时间表尚未敲定。作为拥有超十亿活跃用户的超级App，微信嵌入AI智能体将显著提升场景化办事效率，重塑内部服务连接机制，推动移动互联网生态向“AI Agent即入口”的交互范式转型。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI演示Agentic操作系统原型，实现无App手机界面实时生成</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/05a5e96e5a6c4dedbdd795ec2ea20648.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">OpenAI在Voice Hack Night活动上展示了一款“Agentic操作系统”原型，彻底打破了传统智能手机依赖独立App的生态模式。该系统核心理念为“UI即系统”，手机内无需安装常规App，所有操作界面均由端侧本地模型根据用户指令实时生成，深度推理任务则由云端GPT大模型处理。在现场演示中，开发者通过纯语音指令完成了预订机票、管理日历、发送邮件及梳理待办事项等复杂工作流，全程无需调用第三方软件。此次演示标志着全AI驱动的硬件已从概念验证迈向产业化。OpenAI首席执行官Sam Altman此前多次暗示将重构操作系统设计逻辑，供应链消息显示，其AI智能体手机项目量产时间表已提前至2027年上半年，预示着移动端交互范式或将迎来根本性变革。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI正式成立Robotics事业部，由DALL-E发明者阿迪亚·拉梅什领衔</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/e646ecd29055c89e3b78746923577760.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">OpenAI正式宣布成立Robotics事业部，由DALL-E及Sora核心领导者阿迪亚·拉梅什出任负责人，标志着公司正式进军具身智能领域。该团队由原“世界模拟研究项目”演变而来，旨在利用大模型底座连接物理世界，赋予AI在动态环境中实现AGI级别交互的能力。目前，CEO山姆·奥特曼已启动全栈硬件、系统及机器学习工程师的招募工作。团队规划了明确的路线图：短期聚焦研发协助基础设施建设的机器人，长远目标则是打造通用个人机器人。此次布局反映了OpenAI在技术路线上的战略调整，即放弃此前与外部机器人初创公司的合作，转而自主研发软硬件一体化能力。这一举措意味着OpenAI将直接切入具身智能赛道，与特斯拉等行业巨头展开正面竞争，试图通过端到端模型解决通用大模型在机器人硬件适配上的瓶颈。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI尖端模型与Codex正式登陆AWS平台，支持企业级应用部署</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/40228632a3893ece841b3cb4f05c2fbb.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">6月1日，OpenAI正式宣布其前沿模型（含GPT-5.5）及软件工程智能体Codex全面上架AWS平台。企业用户现可通过Amazon Bedrock直接调用上述模型，并享有AWS原生的安全防护与治理机制。此次集成覆盖商业区域与GovCloud区域，旨在消除企业在安全审查、合规评估及采购流程中的运营壁垒，显著缩短AI技术从评估到投产的周期。目前，安进（Amgen）与欧特克（Autodesk）等行业头部企业已率先开展应用评估，利用AWS基础设施提升生物制药及工业设计领域的工作流效率。此外，OpenAI计划未来在AWS生态中引入“Daybreak”愿景，涵盖网络安全模型与Codex Security，通过自动化代码审查、威胁建模及漏洞验证等功能，强化开发流程中的安全防护能力。此次合作标志着OpenAI尖端AI能力与</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
